deo class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106150/extras/275a30232b019ab8b7b7214b4c43a462.poster.avif?t=1755520551\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106150/extras/275a30232b019ab8b7b7214b4c43a462.webm?t=1755520551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106150/extras/275a30232b019ab8b7b7214b4c43a462.mp4?t=1755520551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay enemy races for meat and sea food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wood by chopping trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
